{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "你读的是谁的链",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 105.18,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "你的系统，从来没有直接读过链。",
   "spoken": "你的系统，从来没有直接读过链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 3.1,
   "speechEnd": 5.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "它读的是某个节点、某个 RPC 服务、某个索引器，告诉它的链。",
   "spoken": "它读的是某个节点、某个 RPC 服务、某个索引器，告诉它的链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 6.12,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 6.12,
   "speechEnd": 11.579
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "数据从 P2P 网络进入节点，经过 RPC，再到索引器和你的系统。",
   "spoken": "数据从 P2P 网络进入节点，经过 RPC，再到索引器和你的系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 12.02,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 12.114,
   "speechEnd": 17.754
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "每一层，都可能给出错误的数据。",
   "spoken": "每一层，都可能给出错误的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 18.16,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 18.16,
   "speechEnd": 20.686
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "第一层是节点客户端。",
   "spoken": "第一层是节点客户端。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 21.1,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 21.202,
   "speechEnd": 23.041
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "2020 年 11 月，Infura 的节点运行旧版 Geth。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 11 月，Infura 的节点运行旧版 Geth。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 23.48,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 23.585,
   "speechEnd": 27.681
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "它遇到一个上游已经修复的共识 bug，停在一条少数派分叉上。",
   "spoken": "它遇到一个上游已经修复的共识 bug，停在一条少数派分叉上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 28.1,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 28.1,
   "speechEnd": 33.917
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "依赖它的 MetaMask 等服务，受到影响。",
   "spoken": "依赖它的 MetaMask 等服务，受到影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 34.32,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 34.32,
   "speechEnd": 37.225
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "Binance、Bithumb 等交易所，暂停了 ETH 和 ERC-20 提币。",
   "spoken": "Binance、Bithumb 等交易所，暂停了 ETH 和 ERC-20 提币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 37.66,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 37.761,
   "speechEnd": 43.163
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "第二层是 RPC 服务，它会宕机、限流、返回过期数据。",
   "spoken": "第二层是 RPC 服务，它会宕机、限流、返回过期数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 43.56,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 43.654,
   "speechEnd": 48.718
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "第三层是索引器，它会延迟，也会解释错。",
   "spoken": "第三层是索引器，它会延迟，也会解释错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 49.14,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 49.14,
   "speechEnd": 53.22
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "第四层是网络路由。",
   "spoken": "第四层是网络路由。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 53.6,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 53.6,
   "speechEnd": 55.329
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "BGP 劫持，是用错误的路由宣告，把别人的流量引到自己的服务器。",
   "spoken": "BGP 劫持，是用错误的路由宣告，把别人的流量引到自己的服务器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 55.74,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 55.847,
   "speechEnd": 61.403
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "2018 年，MyEtherWallet 的 DNS 被这样指向钓鱼站，损失约 15 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2018 年，MyEtherWallet 的 DNS 被这样指向钓鱼站，损失约 15 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 61.8,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 61.8,
   "speechEnd": 68.059
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "2022 年，KLAYswap 的 SDK 下载域名被劫持，下发恶意脚本，损失约 190 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2022 年，KLAYswap 的 SDK 下载域名被劫持，下发恶意脚本，损失约 190 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 68.5,
   "dur": 8.96,
   "speechStart": 68.597,
   "speechEnd": 77.2
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "同年，Celer cBridge 提供合约地址的子域被劫持，损失约 24 万美元。",
   "spoken": "同年，Celer cBridge 提供合约地址的子域被劫持，损失约 24 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 77.68,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 77.68,
   "speechEnd": 83.6
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 84.06,
   "dur": 0.8,
   "speechStart": 84.16,
   "speechEnd": 84.648
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "你隔着一扇窗看车流，决定什么时候过马路。",
   "spoken": "你隔着一扇窗看车流，决定什么时候过马路。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 85.08,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 85.172,
   "speechEnd": 88.574
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "这扇窗可能是一块屏幕，屏幕可能延迟，也可能有人在播录像。",
   "spoken": "这扇窗可能是一块屏幕，屏幕可能延迟，也可能有人在播录像。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 88.98,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 89.076,
   "speechEnd": 94.151
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的马路，你可以换一扇窗再看一眼。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的马路，你可以换一扇窗再看一眼。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 94.56,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 94.653,
   "speechEnd": 99.462
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "很多系统只接了一个 RPC，从来没有第二扇窗。",
   "spoken": "很多系统只接了一个 RPC，从来没有第二扇窗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg2-21.wav",
   "start": 99.9,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 99.9,
   "speechEnd": 103.803
  }
